Count Distinct Digits of a Number
Given an integer, count how many unique digits appear in it.
Input: 552234
Output: 3
int countDistinct (int n) {
int freq[10] = {0}, count = 0;
while (n) {
int d =n % 10;
if(!freq[d]) count++;
freq[d] = 1;
n /= 10;
}
return count;
}

